  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.11.0:\n      - Adds AstraFlow.AspNetCore with minimal API helpers, controller helpers, endpoint filters, redacted diagnostics endpoints, problem details, and health summaries.\n      - Adds AstraFlow.FluentValidation with validation pipeline behaviors, aggregate errors, fail-fast validation, localization hooks, and validation diagnostics.\n      - Adds validation test helpers and updates the ASP.NET Core sample, documentation, packaging, and clean-install verification.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
